    [Connector] Add 8xH100 validation handoff document
    
    Targets an 8xH100 node at a partner. Documents what's in the branch,
    what needs to be written for Phase 3, and known limitations. Gives
    a clear execution plan with tiered node-hour estimates and success
    criteria.
    
    Audits all 115 unit tests plus 4 phase harnesses as ready-to-run.
    Identifies specific code gaps: TP smoke test, benchmark data
    loaders (Musique, HotPotQA), training scripts, eval harnesses,
    and cross-GPU residency manager for the production pressure test.
    
    Flags known limitations: RoPE position bug in routing layer (out
    of scope for this branch), single-cartridge-per-instance startup,
    LMCache plugin is read-only by design, no GPU residency manager.
    
